{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":132260,\"title\":\"Bombay Boys\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Krishna alias Kris Sahani lives in New York, but decides to travel to his homeland in order to act in a movie. While Ricardo Fernandes leaves Australia to travel to Bombay in search of his missing brother, Roger. And finally, Zeres Mistry, from London also travels to Bombay to find his true love. The paths of all three NRIs cross in the taxi to Colaba, and they decide to stick together. They find an apartment, owned by a gay landlord, Pesi Shroff, who openly and lovingly eyes a visibly uncomfortable Zeres.  Things do not go well for Kris as he is asked by Filmmaker, Don Mastana, to act in a movie that is slated to be the worst movie in Bollywood history. Ricardo finds himself at the mercy of the local police, who make it clear to him that they have better things to do than look for his missing brother. It is only a matter of time before the hapless trio to realize that their respective hopes and dreams are soon to turn to hopelessness and nightmares - from which there is no escape.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1S2H4c2jtkPGEARENWrJdKSJo6p.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/no3u0GCKrcHXsLb2yfj85NZmzjt.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":1998,\"runtime\":105,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IN\",\"name\":\"India\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kaizad Gustad\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":86549,\"name\":\"Kaizad Gustad\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5471,\"name\":\"Naveen Andrews\",\"character\":\"Krishna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9b1hxbOZnfofDKSo2tcD1FMPGmx.jpg\"},{\"id\":86212,\"name\":\"Rahul Bose\",\"character\":\"Ricardo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6T0xhsganOB8SI48HCGd99XKj9l.jpg\"},{\"id\":85575,\"name\":\"Luke Kenny\",\"character\":\"Xavier\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3FsRRUJraXNQFYETkxj0xKhdvk9.jpg\"},{\"id\":693,\"name\":\"Roshan Seth\",\"character\":\"Pesi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4TbHkaZxPegaTns250cVXr8F91F.jpg\"},{\"id\":6497,\"name\":\"Naseeruddin Shah\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iaRC8eqliA5clpsQ50sITYoNQGG.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":496243,\"title\":\"Parasite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7IiTTgloJzvGI1TAYymCfbfl3vT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/TU9NIjwzjoKPwQHoHshkFcQUCG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"All unemployed, Ki-taek's family takes peculiar interest in the wealthy and glamorous Parks for their livelihood until they get entangled in an unexpected incident.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":106646,\"title\":\"The Wolf of Wall Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Nwnmyzrtd0FkcRyPqmdzTPppQa.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort's autobiography.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1248832,\"title\":\"Digger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ATXKrIPJyKNwnJ6lcG088Sa6zi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4A3r1AjJg9Wa6ms3MGOScetCY0o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity's savior before the disaster he's unleashed destroys everything.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1314481,\"title\":\"The Devil Wears Prada 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fCAURTUx3YfsJ8k9I0UamjSILiR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dRoFlUbH1l51ACmx5oPCI3jfvZq.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Andy Sachs returns to Runway as Miranda Priestly navigates a new media landscape and Runway's position within. The duo reconnect with former assistant Emily Charlton, now the head of a luxury brand that possesses funding which could ensure Runway's survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1088548,\"title\":\"Bitter Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ppLv2F7dhvI3wxaEoOP1E0OyBPP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a long December holiday weekend, a woman, whose mother has recently died, throws herself into work as a form of escape. Her relentless pace is interrupted when a panic attack forces her to take a break.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":313369,\"title\":\"La La Land\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDO8zWDhfWwoFdKS4fzkUJt0Rf0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nlPCdZlHtRNcF6C9hzUH4ebmV1w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":466272,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in... Hollywood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8j58iEBw9pOXFD2L0nt0ZXeHviB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKTPv9LKKs5L3oO1y5FNObxAPWI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Los Angeles, 1969. TV star Rick Dalton, a struggling actor specializing in westerns, and stuntman Cliff Booth, his best friend, try to survive in a constantly changing movie industry. Dalton is the neighbor of the young and promising actress and model Sharon Tate, who has just married the prestigious Polish director Roman Polanski…\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":77338,\"title\":\"The Intouchables\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1QU7HKgsQbGpzsJbJK4pAVQV9F5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q6OGlZ1KMEb14AC8KbPCxyNOal6.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120467,\"title\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eWdyYQreja6JGCzqHWXpWHDrrPo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jK65srQczOKTpW62wPxwwKztGgE.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1045194,\"title\":\"Lights! Camera! Murder!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kYOO1WXXo83DzwSWXxyDECnJdZK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3OFqLXTDhvxIdYMxniXApKKfO8C.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Even after being warned about the danger, a top fashion team plans a murder mystery film shoot at a secluded spooky castle. Alas, nobody in the crew likes or trusts each other. Is it just a coincidence that real murders are taking place just as in the script or was it all planned?? Only the script writer could tell but. – unfortunately he too commits suicide on this cursed night\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"CU2Qga6ihY0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"BXjDtzWP-rU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"DnuzH1qdBZ4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}